note right of canonical_health_resources
  CANONICAL LONGITUDINAL RECORD
  Source payloads are immutable/versioned; clinical domain tables remain the operational
  source of truth. Bindings and lineage connect both representations without dual-write risk.
end note

note right of patient_identity_clusters
  MASTER PATIENT INDEX
  Matching candidates are never merged automatically when confidence or contradictions
  require human review. Every decision is immutable and reversible through a new decision.
end note

note right of health_export_jobs
  DATA RELEASE CONTROL
  Every export requires purpose, authorization/consent where applicable, minimization,
  optional de-identification, manifest hashing, expiration and auditable delivery.
end note

